{
  "id": "unique-event-008",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#8 - Eliza’s Curse\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,22,41]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You know there is something\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,41,69]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wrong with the girl but the thought\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,69,105]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of leaving her here chained to the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,105,140]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "wall of a madman’s lair is too\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,140,171]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "abhorrent to you . As soon as you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,171,205]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "break her chain, she stares up at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,205,239]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you and mutters a spell. All she\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,239,272]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "needed was to have her hands\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,272,301]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "free to wave at you. Save vs. L4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,301,334]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "magic, at +1 if you have the Will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,334,368]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skill and at +2 if you have it at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,368,402]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert level. If you succeed, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,402,436]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "lose 1 Sanity but you manage to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,436,468]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "escape from the room, with the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,468,499]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "girl’s cackling laughter ringing in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,499,535]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "your ears. If you fail, lose d6 Sanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,535,574]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "as the young witch tries to take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,574,607]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "control of your mind. If after this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,607,643]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you are still sane, you must fight\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,643,678]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "her to make it out of here alive.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,678,712]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Eliza, L3 witch, 3 Life, attacks by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,712,748]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spell (Save vs. L3 Magic or lose 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,748,783]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity). You may not escape from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,783,816]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this fight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,816,828]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you kill Eliza, you find a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,828,858]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "parchment with a curse spell\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,858,887]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "crumpled in her pockets. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,887,920]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "use this to learn the Curse ritual\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,920,955]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-008:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(see Arcane Skills).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[81,955,976]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    81
  ]
}
